{"id":"475896","name":"西红柿鸡蛋虾仁汤","author":"青羽一诺","authorId":"6482739","desc":"","cover":"images/475896/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"西红柿","amount":"2个"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"1个"},{"name":"青虾","amount":"7只"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"10g"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"5g"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"5ml"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"少许"},{"name":"紫苏籽油","amount":"10ml"},{"name":"味精","amount":"5g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"备好食材。","img":"images/475896/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"青虾去头，去虾线，虾头备用","img":"images/475896/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"西红柿洗净切丁，备用","img":"images/475896/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡蛋搅匀","img":"images/475896/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"热锅下油，倒入搅拌好的鸡蛋，不要打散鸡蛋，直接煎成饼状","img":"images/475896/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"待鸡蛋煎成金黄色后取出，然后切成均匀小块","img":"images/475896/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后再加入少许紫苏籽油，放入虾头，然后煸炒出虾油","img":"images/475896/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"然后倒入切好的西红柿丁，翻炒均匀","img":"images/475896/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"再加入青虾","img":"images/475896/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"然后加入热水，盐，味精，生抽，耗油，鸡精","img":"images/475896/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"出锅后再淋上紫苏籽油即可","img":"images/475896/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品","img":"images/475896/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/475896/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}